== Why can I not use /work again today? ==
/work is limited to once per reset window. Reset is at 06:00 Europe/Oslo.

== Why did /work give me 0 payout? ==
There is a small robbery chance that can cancel your daily payout.

== Why can I not fish? ==
You need an owned and equipped rod:
* <code>/rod buy tier:starter</code>
* <code>/rod equip tier:starter</code>

== Why did Claim Rush or Stimulus not pay much? ==
Those depend on Treasury state. If Treasury is low/empty, payout events can be reduced or replaced by refill-safe events.

== Why did not /purge remove pinned messages? ==
Pinned messages are intentionally skipped for safety.

== How do I get Citizens role? ==
Go to Immigration-Center and click the role button panel (posted by admins).

== How do I hatch Mythic pets? ==
You can hatch from normal eggs (very low odds) or craft Mythic Eggs via shards:
* <code>/forge mythic_egg</code>

== Can players trade pets or items? ==
No. Trading is not enabled in launch version.

